function escapeHtml(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]))}
function player(id){return state.players.find(p=>p.id===id)}
function teamBy(name){return clubs.find(c=>c.name===name)}
function nextOpponent(){return clubs[(state.round-1)%9+1]}
function matchDayDate(round){const d=new Date(2025,7,9);d.setDate(d.getDate()+(round-1)*7);return d}
function dateText(date){return date.toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric'}).toUpperCase()}
function updateHeader(){const date=matchDayDate(Math.min(state.round,18));document.getElementById('current-date').textContent=dateText(date);document.getElementById('header-matchday').textContent=`MATCHDAY ${String(Math.min(state.round,18)).padStart(2,'0')}`;document.getElementById('season-progress').innerHTML=`MATCHDAY ${Math.min(state.round,18)} <span>· 18</span>`;document.getElementById('season-bar').style.width=`${Math.min(100,(state.round-1)/18*100)}%`;document.getElementById('squad-count').textContent=state.players.length}
